  "description": "MSBuild task and supporting assets that keep a .NET Android / MAUI app's isolated child processes (e.g. Stripe Tap to Pay :stripetaptopay) free of the Mono/.NET runtime. Strips the auto-generated MonoRuntimeProvider from the merged AndroidManifest, ships a pure-Java Application wrapper, and provides a MAUI bootstrapper so the main process continues to work.",
